  "notes": "USAGE:\nA versatile word used across many domains. In science, {核|かく}{融合|ゆうごう} (nuclear fusion) is a key term. In culture and business, it describes the blending of different traditions, styles, or organizations.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {文化|ぶんか}の{融合|ゆうごう}: cultural fusion\n- {核|かく}{融合|ゆうごう}: nuclear fusion\n- {融合|ゆうごう}させる: to fuse, to merge (transitive)\n- {融合|ゆうごう}する: to fuse, to merge (intransitive)",
